- op: discuss  # 9380
  at: '2026-03-08T03:08:23Z'  # 9380
  by: agent  # 9380
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9380
  clock: 2  # 9380
  nonce: '9380'  # 9380
  message: "Root cause: do_sync builds commit on origin/dev, pushes, polls CI (takes ~60-120s). During that time, another sync PR may merge and advance dev. When merge is attempted, dev has moved forward so the PR head is 'behind the base branch' (HTTP 405). The merge cascade (ff→rebase→merge-commit) fails for AGit-flow PRs. Fix: after CI passes, re-fetch origin/dev, and if it diverged, rebuild the commit on the new base (re-read-tree, re-write-tree, re-commit-tree, update-ref, force-push) before attempting merge."  # 9380
