  clock: 4  # 1c67
  nonce: 1c67  # 1c67
  message: "Fixed in PR #1991. After CI passes, re-fetches origin/dev and rebuilds the sync commit on the new base if it diverged, then force-pushes. 4 new tests covering diverge, read-tree failure, fetch failure, rev-parse failure. Combined with circuit breaker (PR #1982) and escalation (PR #1990), this is a complete fix for the auto-sync merge failure issue."  # 1c67
